<title>USA: Santa Fe Pipeline named in complaint.</title>
<headline>Santa Fe Pipeline named in complaint.</headline>
<dateline>ORANGE, Calif. 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Santa Fe Pacific Pipeline Partners LP on Thursday said it was named in a complaint filed with the California Public Utilities Commission that challenges the partnership's rates for transporting petroleum through its pipelines.</p>
<p>Atlantic Richfield Co's Arco Products unit, Mobil Corp and Texaco Inc are requesting prospective rate adjustments in their complaint, Santa Fe said.</p>
<p>The partnership has not had an opportunity to review the complaint, filed on April 7, and was unable to comment on it, the partnership said.</p>
</text>
